OL,3,GNEWSAReform wins first seat on council
OL,4,Ain by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has secured its first seat on
OL,7,Fa council after winning a by-election.
OL,9,FJosh Kirkwood was elected as councillor
OL,10,Ffor the Harraby South ward of the
OL,11,FLabour-controlled Cumberland Council on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,FThe by-election was called in July
OL,15,Fafter the former Labour councillor Lucy
OL,16,FPatrick stepped down.
OL,18,FKirkwood said he hoped to bring a
OL,19,F"fresh perspective" to the council.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
